### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. The login cookie is kept between requests.
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kevin", "email": "kevin@example.com", "password": "superSecret1" }

### Login (sets the httpOnly "token" cookie and also returns the token)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kevin", "password": "superSecret1" }

### Who am I? (protected)
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### All users (protected)
GET {{base}}/users

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
